00:19:52,633 --> 00:19:54,533
It's my first time hearing it.

538
00:19:54,533 --> 00:19:55,433
Are you pleased with it?

539
00:19:55,966 --> 00:19:56,833
Yes.

540
00:19:56,833 --> 00:20:00,133
[Definitely happy about it] I feel great.

541
00:20:00,133 --> 00:20:01,900
If you're a MONSTIEZ,

542
00:20:01,900 --> 00:20:03,900
don't think 'only ASA can pull this off'.

543
00:20:03,900 --> 00:20:07,433
Fashion is something we can share and try together.

544
00:20:07,433 --> 00:20:09,900
If you wear the same outfits

545
00:20:09,900 --> 00:20:12,233
or accessories we've worn before,

546
00:20:12,233 --> 00:20:16,200
it might make us feel like we're connected.

547
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,900
Through fashion,

548
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:21,466
It'd be nice to interact and share that feeling.

549
00:20:21,466 --> 00:20:26,266
Do you have any practice-room style aesthetics or tips?

550
00:20:26,266 --> 00:20:27,700
When you dance,

551
00:20:27,700 --> 00:20:29,833
wearing baggy clothes

552
00:20:29,833 --> 00:20:31,433
makes your movements look bigger.

553
00:20:31,433 --> 00:20:33,000
[Great tip]

554
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:35,466
I feel like wearing leggings

555
00:20:35,466 --> 00:20:38,500
makes the vibe a little less hip...

556
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:42,400
But all of us wore leggings when we were trainees.

557
00:20:43,666 --> 00:20:44,966
[RORA]

558
00:20:44,966 --> 00:20:48,400
I used to wear leggings as a trainee.

559
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,200
Two layers at a time. [Lol]

560
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:50,800
[Self-callout] It was cold!

561
00:20:50,800 --> 00:20:52,033
[Apparently it was cold lol]

562
00:20:52,033 --> 00:20:54,433
[Witness 1] The socks! They were the highlight!

563
00:20:54,433 --> 00:20:57,533
[Witness 2] Black T-shirt and leggings.

564
00:20:57,533 --> 00:20:59,333
[Endless witness reports] With the white socks.

565
00:20:59,333 --> 00:21:00,766
[RORA not found] Pulled up to here!

566
00:21:00,766 --> 00:21:03,666
[AHYEON entered the chat] The leggings with stripes!

567
00:21:03,666 --> 00:21:05,866
[Okay, and?]

568
00:21:05,866 --> 00:21:07,666
I have a question.

569
00:21:07,666 --> 00:21:09,500
How many leggings do you own?

570
00:21:09,500 --> 00:21:11,000
[RORA leggings case file]

571
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,700
When I was a trainee,

572
00:21:12,700 --> 00:21:15,300
I had tons.

573
00:21:15,300 --> 00:21:18,766
[Baby Dain's leggings era] I used to love them.

574
00:21:18,766 --> 00:21:20,733
But all of us wore them.

575
00:21:20,733 --> 00:21:23,333
[BABYMONSTER comes clean]

576
00:21:23,333 --> 00:21:25,766
I wasn't the only one dressing like that.

577
00:21:25,766 --> 00:21:27,833
[YG trainee dress code(?)] It was a signature look.

578
00:21:27,833 --> 00:21:28,933
It was tradition.

579
00:21:28,933 --> 00:21:31,100
But trainees nowadays

580
00:21:31,100 --> 00:21:33,166
dress really stylish.

581
00:21:33,166 --> 00:21:34,633
[You were born in 2008] You're saying nowadays?

582
00:21:34,633 --> 00:21:36,400
[08 baby already saying 'kids these days'?]

583
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:37,866
Then I guess you were

584
00:21:37,866 --> 00:21:39,666
kind of old-fashioned back then.

585
00:21:39,666 --> 00:21:41,066
[Excuse me]

586
00:21:41,900 --> 00:21:42,933
Let's move on.

587
00:21:42,933 --> 00:21:44,333
[Leggings phase Dain was so cute]

588
00:21:44,333 --> 00:21:48,933
Hello, I'm a former study abroad student and current part-timer MONSTIEZ.

589
00:21:48,933 --> 00:21:50,733
My dream is to become a world-class interpreter

590
00:21:50,733 --> 00:21:52,933
and meet the BABYMONSTER members.

591
00:21:52,933 --> 00:21:54,100
To make that dream come true,

592
00:21:54,100 --> 00:21:56,700
I went abroad and studied really hard,

593
00:21:56,700 --> 00:21:59,233
but I had to come back to Korea due to family circumstances.

594
00:21:59,233 --> 00:22:02,800
I remember crying my eyes out on the flight back home.

595
00:22:02,800 --> 00:22:06,000
These days, I'm working part-time at a cafe,

596
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:08,166
trying to stay strong while waiting

597
00:22:08,166 --> 00:22:09,500
for the day I can finally achieve my dream,

598
00:22:09,500 --> 00:22:10,700
but it hasn't been easy.

599
00:22:10,700 --> 00:22:15,000
Could you comfort me with a song?

600
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:16,700
[A MONSTIEZ in need of comfort]

601
00:22:16,700 --> 00:22:18,966
If you have a song you listen to

602
00:22:18,966 --> 00:22:20,233
whenever you need comfort,

603
00:22:20,233 --> 00:22:22,733
I think it'd be nice to sing it for MONSTIEZ.

604
00:22:22,733 --> 00:22:24,066
I have one!

605
00:22:24,300 --> 00:22:28,666
It's 'Niji' by Aqua Timez.

606
00:22:28,666 --> 00:22:29,666
[I know it]

607
00:22:29,666 --> 00:22:33,100
[It's okay, if we look up]

608
00:22:33,100 --> 00:22:36,900
[It's alright, see, the seven-colored bridge]

609
00:22:36,900 --> 00:22:43,166
[We can finally laugh together under the same sky]

610
00:22:43,166 --> 00:22:46,100
[Ascended after hearing Angel RURU's voice] It's been so long since I heard your vocals.

611
00:22:46,100 --> 00:22:48,433
[What message of comfort does the song carry?] Could you tell us about the lyrics?

612
00:22:48,433 --> 00:22:50,400
The lyrics tell you,

613
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:51,300
it's okay.

614
00:22:51,300 --> 00:22:52,600
Just like this...

615
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:54,400
Look at the sky.

616
00:22:54,400 --> 00:22:55,733
There's a rainbow.

617
00:22:55,733 --> 00:22:57,766
[Hearing the explanation made it even more comforting]

618
00:22:57,766 --> 00:23:00,700
[Well-known song that gives hope and support to youth]

619
00:23:00,700 --> 00:23:01,600
For me...

620
00:23:01,600 --> 00:23:04,200
BLACKPINK's 'Love To Hate Me'

621
00:23:04,200 --> 00:23:05,766
is a song I really like.

622
00:23:05,766 --> 00:23:07,166
The lyrics of that song

623
00:23:07,166 --> 00:23:09,500
are also about loving yourself a little more,

624
00:23:09,500 --> 00:23:10,833
and taking time to reflect on yourself.

625
00:23:10,833 --> 00:23:12,133
[A song AHYEON recommends and personally found comfort in]

626
00:23:12,133 --> 00:23:13,533
[Love that]

627
00:23:28,966 --> 00:23:32,533
[I'm cured thanks to the vocal genius]

628
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:36,900
[Final RECORD]

629
00:23:36,900 --> 00:23:38,533
Shall we check it out right now?

630
00:23:42,433 --> 00:23:43,833
How did you like the new records

631
00:23:43,833 --> 00:23:46,233
BABYMONSTER created today?

632
00:23:46,233 --> 00:23:47,300
[Our records today?]

633
00:23:47,300 --> 00:23:48,700
There aren't many places for us

634
00:23:48,700 --> 00:23:52,233
to fully express our own stories.

635
00:23:52,233 --> 00:23:53,766
This was another chance

636
00:23:53,766 --> 00:23:56,266
for our fans to get to know us better,

637
00:23:56,266 --> 00:23:57,833
so I was really happy.

638
00:23:57,833 --> 00:23:58,433
We also got to

639
00:23:58,433 --> 00:24:01,100
talk a lot about "CHOOM",

640
00:24:01,100 --> 00:24:01,900
which was great.

641
00:24:01,900 --> 00:24:03,066
Plus, our host

642
00:24:03,066 --> 00:24:04,800
did such an amazing job.

643
00:24:04,800 --> 00:24:05,666
[Touched]

644
00:24:05,666 --> 00:24:07,366
[Couldn't agree more] You're improving more and more.

645
00:24:07,366 --> 00:24:09,433
Can we look forward to MC RORA in the future?

646
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,400
If you call me, I'm there.

647
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:13,333
[Baby Yoo Jae-suk, baby Jang Do-youn always on standby]

648
00:24:13,333 --> 00:24:15,266
Please call her!

649
00:24:15,266 --> 00:24:18,033
[Manifesting MC RORA!]

650
00:24:18,033 --> 00:24:24,600
We are back with our new Mini Album.

651
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:28,533
It was really fun to play games on Spotify,

652
00:24:28,533 --> 00:24:32,666
and introduce our album as well.

653
00:24:32,666 --> 00:24:36,566
We also have concerts scheduled for June 26, 27, and 28.

654
00:24:36,566 --> 00:24:38,133
[Please come see us]

655
00:24:38,133 --> 00:24:41,000
Thank you so much Spotify for having us here.

656
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:43,500
I hope you guys enjoyed this.

657
00:24:43,500 --> 00:24:46,500
And you can also listen to our new Mini Album "CHOOM"

658
00:24:46,500 --> 00:24:47,733
on Spotify!

659
00:24:48,900 --> 00:24:51,033
[Perfect ending]

660
00:24:53,900 --> 00:24:55,566
This has been BABYMONSTER, ready to take over the world with 'CHOOM',

661
00:24:56,733 --> 00:24:57,600
And our host.

662
00:24:57,600 --> 00:25:00,066
[Born-to-be-MC RORA]

663
00:25:00,066 --> 00:25:04,266
[A worldwide dance party with BABYMONSTER]

664
00:25:22,766 --> 00:25:23,833
What was that?

665
00:25:23,833 --> 00:25:26,633
You want to hear more stories from BABYMONSTER?

666
00:25:26,633 --> 00:25:28,933
Then go to Spotify right now,

667
00:25:28,933 --> 00:25:31,933
and look up K-Pop ON! Video Podcast!

668
00:25:31,933 --> 00:25:32,633
[Bye]

